-- ============================================================================
-- Migration: Sheet Metal Rules -- handling allowance, bend radius limit,
--            blank/hole guidance (staging)
-- Purpose: Lands the reconciliation export's handling-allowance/bend-radius/
--          blank-and-hole-guidance rules into the same lossless staging
--          table earlier migrations created. See migration 479's header for
--          the staging/promotion architecture. Source name sanitized per
--          the standing rule against naming the licensed source.
--
--          Real corroboration found (no code change needed -- these CONFIRM
--          values this app already uses, sourced independently earlier this
--          reconciliation):
--            - hole_guidance.common.holeToBend = 1.5 == this app's own
--              HOLE_TO_BEND_MIN_FACTOR (dfm-scoring.service.ts).
--            - hole_guidance.common.holeToHole = 2.0 == this app's own
--              PUNCH_INTERFERENCE check (nearest_hole_distance_mm < 2 x
--              diameter) in scoreSheetMetalHole().
--
--          Real gap found, NOT built (a new capability, not a data fix):
--          handling_allowance has 5 process-specific USD-by-weight-bracket
--          tables (Generic Press, Laser Punch, Plasma Punch, Std Press,
--          Turret Press handling) -- all five are IDENTICAL curves
--          (0kg->$0 ... 27kg->$9 ... 50kg->$25 ... above->$46). Turret Press
--          is a REAL, live-costed process in this app (Turret Punching/Hole
--          Punching/Nibbling); grepped for any "handling cost" concept in
--          this app's process costing and found none -- turret-punch (and
--          every press-family process) costing has NO material-handling
--          surcharge line item today. Adding one changes every existing
--          quote's cost for these processes -- a real product decision,
--          flagged for the user to decide on, not silently added.
--
--          dtc_bend_radius_limits (1 row, "Any" material, 0.5x multiplier)
--          is a generic catch-all fallback, coarser than this app's own
--          already-sourced per-material BEND_RADIUS_MIN_FACTOR table --
--          does NOT supersede it, staged for reference only.
--
--          blank_guidance (7 rows, minEdgeRadius/minUtilization by
--          operation) has no known consumer -- this app's blank/nesting
--          engine (sheet-metal-nesting.engine.ts) does not currently check
--          either metric.
-- Author: Principal Engineering Team
-- Date: 2026-08-20
